	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bbe32bd1906bb837","type":"text","text":"UserDataProviderWrapper(child: **--**)\n---\n```dart\nUserDatabase? database = Provider.of<UserDatabase?>(context);\nreturn databse == null ? Loading() :\n\tStreamProvider<UserData?>(\n\t\tvalue: database!.user,\n\t\tchild: --\t\n\t);\n\n```","x":-1040,"y":1140,"width":940,"height":400},
		{"id":"eb3f7cbca6b13759","type":"text","text":"UserDatabaseProviderWrapper(child: --)\n---\n```dart\nUserObject? user = Provider.of<UserObject?>(context);\nreturn user == null ? Loading() :\n\tProvider<UserDatabse>(\n\t\tvalue: UserDatabase(user.uid),\n\t\tchild: UserDataProviderWrapper(child: --)\t\n\t);\n```","x":-1040,"y":700,"width":860,"height":360},
		{"id":"fa1b91115f5e3c12","type":"text","text":"UserObjectProviderWrapper(child: *--*)\n---\nInitialize Firebase.\nWhile uninitialized:\n```dart\nreturn Loading();\n```\nWhen initialized:\n```dart\nreturn StreamProvider<UserObject?>(\n\tvalue: AuthService().user,\n\t// child: loading ? Loading() : UserDatabaseProviderWrapper(child: --) \n\tchild: loading ? LoginPage() : UserDatabaseProviderWrapper(child: --) \n);\n```\n\n","x":-1040,"y":30,"width":1040,"height":630},
		{"id":"97b8197488a534f7","type":"text","text":"MyApp()\n---\nSets up routes and uses **UserObjectProviderWrapper** in builder to curround all possible Widgets.\n```dart\nreturn MaterialApp(\n\ttheme: ...,\n\troutes: {\n\t\t'/': (context) => HomePage(),\n\t\t...\n\t},\n\tbuilder: (context, child) => \n\t\tUserObjectProviderWrapper(child: child)\n);\n```\n","x":-1028,"y":-640,"width":840,"height":600},
