		{"id":"46ce89b12c5997f7","type":"text","text":"GradeCoursesPage()\n---\nList of all courses for the grade. Is pushed with:\n```dart\nNavigator.of(context).pushNamed(\n\t'grade_courses_page',\n\targuments: *grade_id*\n);\n```","x":736,"y":419,"width":680,"height":360},
		{"id":"9447a0430afc8392","type":"text","text":"CourseContentPage()\n---\nHas a *\"Почати\"* button to start a course in game mode. ","x":731,"y":959,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"ba4eb5250fd996a3","type":"text","text":"```dart\nonTap: () {\n\tuser.courses.add(Course(\n\t\tcourse_data: course,\n\t\tcourse_progress: CourseProgress() \n\t));\n\tUserDatabase database = Provider.of<UserDatabase>(context);\n\tdatabase.updateUserData(user);\n\tNavigator.of(context).pushReplacementNamed(\n\t\t'/game_course_page',\n\t\targuments: course,\n\t);\n}\n```","x":1076,"y":1280,"width":959,"height":520},
		{"id":"9582b3651c3d8790","type":"text","text":"CourseGamePage()\n---\n```dart\nfinal Course course;\nCourseGamePage({this.course})\n```\n```dart\nCourseGamePageState {\n\tWidget build(context) {\n\t\tif (course == null) {\n\t\t\tCourse? course = Modal.of(context)?.settings.arguments as Course;\n\t\t\tif (course == null) {\n\t\t\t\t// go to home screen, log error\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\t// render course page\n\t}\n}\n```","x":2270,"y":540,"width":1200,"height":740},
